# Agent Orchestrator — Codex Rules

## PREFLIGHT — MANDATORY

Before any task, read the entire `.agent/` directory in this order:

1. `.agent/workspace-memory.md` — project context
2. `.agent/skills/` — ALL skill files (behavioral rules, folder conventions, safe deletion, etc.)
3. `.agent/rules/` — project-specific rules
4. `.agent/config.md` — agent configuration

## Project
- Node.js + TypeScript + ESM
- Phase 2: Hybrid Agentic Architecture
- Conventional Commits for git

## Standards
- TypeScript strict, Zod validation
- Dev docs → `dev-docs/`, Dev tasks → `tasks/pending/`
- Product plans → `plan/pending/`, Product skills → `reference/skills/`
- Never delete files without explicit permission
- Never change architecture without asking
